TITLE Calcite kinetics pH 2, 200C, Cu and Ba, pe 4
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    Cu 10
    Ba 5
    Cl 25
    -water 1
KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0 1.0
        -m  1.0
        -parms 1.0 1.0
        -tol 1e-12
    -steps 1000 in 100
USER_PUNCH
    -head step time_s m_calcite
    10 PUNCH STEP_NO, TOTAL_TIME, KIN("Calcite")
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -user_punch true
END
